    "Aim to shatter as many bricks as you can with one throw.",
    "Utilize boosters to clear away obstacles and eliminate bricks.",
    "Finish levels to access decoration sections and upgrade campsites.",
    "No internet connection? No worries! Enjoy offline gameplay whenever and wherever you desire."
